  <data name="Label1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>• Borrow up to 3 books at a time.
• Select the books you want to borrow.
• Borrow Date is today.
• Due Date is 2 days after borrowing.
• Click Borrow to confirm.
• Click Clear to remove your selections.</value>
